auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{adminToken}}
}

docs {
  # OmniGate API collection

  Import this folder in Bruno (https://usebruno.com) or run it headless with `bru run`.

  1. Start the stack: `docker compose up -d`
  2. Seed once: `docker compose exec gateway pnpm seed` and copy the demo API key into `apiKey`
  3. Run `auth/login` first: it stores `adminToken` for every other request

  Every request under /admin/v1 uses that bearer token; the gateway requests use the API key.
}
